        "message": "You are the Drain Watchdog. Run these steps:\n\n1. Read the last 200 lines of today's gateway log at C:\\Users\\wifik\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\openclaw\\openclaw-$(Get-Date -Format 'yyyy-MM-dd').log\n2. Count how many 'still draining' messages appear\n3. Check for 'drain timeout reached' or 'failed to reacquire gateway lock'\n\nIf drain stalls >= 3 OR drain timeout detected OR lock conflict detected:\n   - Use subagents(action='list') to get all active sub-agents\n   - Use subagents(action='kill') on each active sub-agent\n   - Wait 5 seconds\n   - Use gateway(action='restart') to restart the gateway\n   - Log the intervention to logs/drain-watchdog.log\n\nIf no issues found — reply NO_REPLY.\n\nKeep it fast. This runs every 2 minutes.",
